---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — FrameCraft"
  description="Privacy Policy for FrameCraft Video Frame Extractor. Learn how we protect your privacy with zero video file uploads and local browser processing."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 space-y-6 font-sans text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
    <div class="border-b border-zinc-850 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-100 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono mt-1">Last Updated: September 4, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400">1. Client-Side Processing Guarantee</h2>
      <p>
        FrameCraft operates entirely client-side. When you select or drag a video file into our web tool, the video file is read exclusively by your local web browser's HTML5 canvas and Media API engines. <strong>No video content, frame snapshot, or metadata is transmitted to, stored on, or processed by any external server.</strong>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400">2. Cookies and Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
      <p>
        FrameCraft displays advertisements served by third-party vendors, including Google AdSense. Third-party vendors use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to FrameCraft and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400">3. Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We may use privacy-preserving analytics services (such as Google Analytics) to aggregate anonymous statistics regarding website visitors (e.g. page views, country of origin, browser type). No personally identifiable information (PII) is captured.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400">4. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-400 underline">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
